Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.06,0:00:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running, forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.08,0:00:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is calling out, so ride the waves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.92,0:00:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all together as one,\Nso let's sail in the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.64,0:00:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All our dreams are never-ending, so\Nlet's wake up, wake up, wake up, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.94,0:00:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartbeat, we will be one! Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.54,0:00:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though our hearts have\Ntraveled different paths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.62,0:00:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We are best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.26,0:00:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Our freedom is our only compass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.12,0:00:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's pointing us along the\Nmany roads that come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We will keep on running forward every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.60,0:00:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Go east, go west.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.98,0:00:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we keep looking to the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.76,0:00:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see everything all crystal clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.60,0:00:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all so thrilled that we\Ncan't wait until the dawn arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.90,0:00:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So we'll just bring the\Nsun ourselves to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If the winds blow, it's waiting\Nwhere we should be going. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.64,0:01:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, we're\Nshining, running forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.28,0:01:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All of our dreams will\Nmerge into one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.34,0:01:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where we go,\Nwe'll be fine and free.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.06,0:01:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause all our treasure is our strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.78,0:01:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.36,0:01:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is coming out, so ride away!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.42,0:01:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all together as well, so\Nlet's just stay with us, son!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.24,0:01:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,All our dreams are never ending, so\Nlet's wake up, wake up, wake up, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.48,0:01:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartbeat, we will be one, go hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.40,0:01:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,My darkness will swallow the\Nworld, just you wait and see!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.38,0:01:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'll lose to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.36,0:01:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be king of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.84,0:01:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger's treasure belongs to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.44,0:01:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll ride non-stop and travel farther.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.70,0:01:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,than we've ever gone And then tomorrow we
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.36,0:01:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,will find suspense And then commence to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.44,0:02:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Live out another day so intense.\NThat's right, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.28,0:02:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Running forever. Let's go along\Nwith curiosity. Our feelings lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.32,0:02:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,the way straight to a brand new day Into\Nanother adventure Come on, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.24,0:02:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Running forever. Open the map inside your\Nheart and see. No matter where we end up,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.86,0:02:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,our mods will never give up There's a fire\Nin our dreams and you can never, never,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.42,0:02:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,never, never stop it We\Nwill be one, go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.62,0:02:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.58,0:02:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Black-Legged Sanji, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.08,0:02:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Diablo Jamba!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.84,0:02:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Premier Hachi's head!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.12,0:02:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Penta-chromatic strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.02,0:02:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hachi's head! But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.92,0:03:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have the strength\Nto protect anybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.72,0:03:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He's headed right for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.84,0:03:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.26,0:03:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare turn your back\Non me, or my Boa Hancock.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.30,0:03:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm pre-respecting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.28,0:03:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.26,0:03:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.17,0:03:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.44,0:03:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell's happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.28,0:03:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.66,0:03:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like something's\Nholding Sanji still in mid-air.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.48,0:03:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the young master's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.68,0:03:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no hope of escape for your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.10,0:03:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Blacklegs captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.14,0:03:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,As helpless as a fly in a spider's web.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.20,0:03:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,All he can do now is\Nhope for a quick death.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.18,0:04:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that? A whip?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.28,0:04:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you waiting around for?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.56,0:04:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Use a coup to burst and go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.56,0:04:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not leaving you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.76,0:04:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.92,0:04:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.42,0:04:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to break free!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.04,0:04:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Shambles!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.32,0:04:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The room!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.14,0:04:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.02,0:04:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.82,0:04:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.52,0:04:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We've changed Sanji's life!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.80,0:04:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There's been a slight change of plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.02,0:04:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,To the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.08,0:04:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A ten-point landing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.08,0:04:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.96,0:04:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me I'm back on\Nthis cursed ship again!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.48,0:04:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.86,0:04:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that you, Giolla?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.58,0:04:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Break me free!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.72,0:04:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I would love to, but I'm\Na little tied up myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.48,0:05:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That won't happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.44,0:05:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The flamingos come back for round two!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.04,0:05:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Blackleg!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.24,0:05:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How are things going with the factory?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.02,0:05:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We found out where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.76,0:05:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But Franky says it's gonna be tougher\Nto take down than we first thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.34,0:05:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And my father?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.46,0:05:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Was he able to rescue Kanjiro safely?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.00,0:05:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Please tell me that all is well!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.50,0:05:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Kinemon's friend is at the factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.36,0:05:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If we pull this off, he'll be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.72,0:05:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We still need more time,\Nyou bastard that isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.48,0:05:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,my heart is it so you were keeping it back
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.96,0:05:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,here in the ship cabin\Ni'm afraid this one's
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.82,0:05:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,mine I had, yours with me,\Nnever left my side? Ah?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.22,0:05:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Trickery.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.34,0:05:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All my plans thwarted by\None miserable little lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.28,0:06:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.12,0:06:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.46,0:06:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to head to\NZoe and take him. To Zoe?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.26,0:06:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave you the Vivre card that\Nleads to the next island already.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.44,0:06:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We're leaving already?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.48,0:06:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we supposed to do\Nabout Luffy and the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.68,0:06:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There is only one task left\Nthat remains on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.58,0:06:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroying the factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.36,0:06:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as we're done, we'll\Ncatch up with you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.60,0:06:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not going anywhere yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.42,0:06:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think we're going to set sail\Nwithout our captain, you're nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.52,0:06:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We take orders from Luffy, not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.38,0:06:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a Navy battleship\Nflying right over us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.46,0:06:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,How close is that even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.70,0:06:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be Fujitora.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.60,0:06:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The flamingo's closing\Nit from the other side!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.24,0:06:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You can wait for Straw Hat if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.50,0:06:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But you have to guard Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.96,0:07:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.70,0:07:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Big rocks are falling out of the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.04,0:07:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Are those meteors? Crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.60,0:07:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,As a senior member of the Straw Hat\Ncrew, I vote that we get out of here now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.70,0:07:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I second that motion! Then\Nget moving! Hold up, Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.26,0:07:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I realize it's important to get Caesar\Nas far away from here as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.30,0:07:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's pretty obvious\Nwe have to leave him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.62,0:07:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But the operation in Dressrosa was\Njust supposed to be a waypoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.62,0:07:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought our shared goal was taking\Ndown Kaido of the Four Emperors.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.00,0:07:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder why are you getting\Nso hung up on Doflamingo?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.28,0:07:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Meteors! Did you forget? Tucked!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.58,0:07:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Iso, they managed to\Nput a hole in the bilge!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.38,0:07:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Law's on the ship below us, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.78,0:08:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It was mighty careless of\Nme to overlook that fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.80,0:08:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you still eating\Nin a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.58,0:08:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.84,0:08:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a premonition.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.48,0:08:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The battle's taking a turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.80,0:08:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn the boat around.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.44,0:08:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.12,0:08:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A whip again. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.58,0:08:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Joker, get me off of this boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.34,0:08:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Overheat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.26,0:08:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami, look for a spot without any clouds\Nand set sail for it now. What? But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.78,0:08:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Because Doflamingo has the\Npowers of the string fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.76,0:08:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He moves through the air by\Nattaching strings to clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.66,0:08:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,A clear sky means he can't chase you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.46,0:08:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.46,0:08:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that explains a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.02,0:09:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting around for?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.72,0:09:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Who did burst fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.58,0:09:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.49,0:09:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Eyes over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.10,0:09:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Locke, how could you do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.12,0:09:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me, young master.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.26,0:09:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't let them escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.70,0:09:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the point of letting\Nhalf the Straw Hats escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.44,0:09:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you forgetting something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.58,0:09:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest of them are still in dress rosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.76,0:09:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All i have to do is take them\Nhostage and the ones who ran
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.06,0:09:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,off will sail right back and\Noffer me caesar for their release.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.18,0:10:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How many people have underestimated\Nthem and gotten burned?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.38,0:10:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You really want to add\Nyour name to that list?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.46,0:10:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,At any rate,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.50,0:10:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,my pirate alliance with the straw hag\Ncrew is coming to its natural conclusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.02,0:10:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Do i have to spell it out for\Nyou from the moment we teamed up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.30,0:10:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,My only goal was shutting\Ndown the smile factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.92,0:10:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I was using them, and while killing\Nyou today would bring me pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.36,0:10:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, it doesn't matter, since\NKaido will do it sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.00,0:10:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,after you end up losing the smiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.56,0:10:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How noble of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.98,0:10:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sacrificing your life to stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.78,0:10:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'd love to see what chaos the\Nworld falls into once you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.16,0:10:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,First and foremost, I want to make\Nyou pay for what you did 13 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.26,0:11:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Joker!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.22,0:11:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.40,0:11:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Holding Gyula hostage won't\Nget you anywhere with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.28,0:11:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.84,0:11:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll gladly give my life for\Nthe sake of the young master.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.44,0:11:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'd advise you to run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.02,0:11:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.14,0:11:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Things got messy back on Straw Hat's ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.50,0:11:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I admit my plan isn't going\Nquite as smoothly as I'd hoped.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.96,0:11:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My, you are still mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.12,0:11:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Grudges aren't healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.84,0:11:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.64,0:11:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't just a grudge.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.84,0:11:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I've lived my whole life\Nto achieve this goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.12,0:11:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see his dream through to the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.38,0:12:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I sure hope Trappy's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.64,0:12:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Pay attention, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.32,0:12:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,See anything out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.92,0:12:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Brooke reporting here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,At a 45-degree angle,\Neverything looks just lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.08,0:12:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If he comes near us again, then I'll use\Nmy weapon to blow away all the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.76,0:12:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't be able to follow us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.48,0:12:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You better protect my sweet Robin,\Neven if it costs you your lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.94,0:12:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.38,0:12:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.29,0:12:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I was making sure that Robin's still\Nsafe—she's with Franky and Usopp right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.28,0:12:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, so if Zoro and Kin'emon meet\Nup with Luffy, we should be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.82,0:12:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.80,0:12:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Mosshead's probably too bad with directions\Nto find his way to the Coliseum alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.92,0:12:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.84,0:12:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Kinemon's with him, so they'll make\Nit—I'm awful worried about Trafi though?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.32,0:12:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,trafi though
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.34,0:12:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh, he's a big boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.20,0:13:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems he's planning to let Kaido kill\NDoflamingo instead of offing the guy himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.40,0:13:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So he just has to focus\Non escaping now. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.16,0:13:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.72,0:13:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why'd you turn back into a dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.72,0:13:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.63,0:13:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I just can't stop thinking\Nabout what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.04,0:13:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That flying man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.76,0:13:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.00,0:13:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I remember seeing him the\Nlast time I came to Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.16,0:13:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.78,0:13:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, you're gonna kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.56,0:13:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.30,0:13:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to be a gladiator, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.12,0:13:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Then act like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.80,0:13:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,A gladiator should fight for his life,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.74,0:13:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,not run around like a chicken\Nwith its head cut off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.08,0:13:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you can't bring\Nyourself to kill anyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.16,0:14:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,the least you can do is let\Nsomebody cut you to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.46,0:14:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't act like you don't know;
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.74,0:14:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,all humans are the same—everyone gets\Nriled up over a little bloodshed,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.64,0:14:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,and that's why they're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.96,0:14:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, that's just an attainment\Nnow. Entertain! Entertain! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.06,0:14:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Piece of garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.58,0:14:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Better not see anyone else\Ncutting corners. Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.36,0:14:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Kinemo, there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.60,0:14:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, it's Kanjudo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.20,0:14:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I found a harbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.66,0:14:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to steal a ship and escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.66,0:14:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This land is too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.72,0:14:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I just realized that foul monster\Nis holding Conis captive as we speak
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.96,0:14:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,and now i simply cannot stop worrying
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.34,0:14:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,please be safe
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.04,0:14:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Conjure all. Why do you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.44,0:15:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,look so happy don't worry being taken\Nhostage is no big deal whatever they
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.92,0:15:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,wanted out of him i'm sure they won't\Ntorture him too bad He'll be okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.96,0:15:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,you're obviously thinking\Nabout something else at least
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.76,0:15:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,pretend to care that reminds me\Nviolet said she'd be okay, too
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.36,0:15:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.46,0:15:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I talked to my friend, and I'm\Ncertain the government will protect me
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.60,0:15:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.51,0:15:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, they're probably\Nwaiting for me at the harbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.24,0:15:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I'd feel better if I could\Ngo along with you as long as you're safe
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.88,0:15:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You've done enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.06,0:15:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do this thanks to all your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.40,0:15:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I ever show my gratitude?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.78,0:15:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we could start with a little\Nkiss on the cheek, and then maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.48,0:15:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.72,0:15:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It would seem your sheep is\Nunder attack by fighting fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.90,0:15:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh. What are those? No time! Just go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.68,0:15:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.18,0:16:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Damnit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.09,0:16:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,She's still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.20,0:16:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd she get this far?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.76,0:16:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Horse? Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.94,0:16:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Take me to the palace, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.86,0:16:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.36,0:16:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What's got you so upset\Nnow, whatever weirdo?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.84,0:16:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me why you know so\Nmuch about me and Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.00,0:16:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been your biggest fan for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.44,0:16:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, so pathetic—you can't even answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.50,0:16:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Could
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.56,0:16:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I could I have your autograph?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.44,0:17:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.14,0:17:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,it What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.40,0:17:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If I bring Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.64,0:17:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy to you, then will\Nyou give me your autograph?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.10,0:17:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be a big help if you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.36,0:17:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, come on. Hop to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.02,0:17:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, oh, what? Oh, then wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.60,0:17:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.82,0:17:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bring Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.02,0:17:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy back here if it kills me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.42,0:17:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not that serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.70,0:17:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,She just won't quit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.62,0:17:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's her favorite move!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.36,0:17:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's come to be known as\Nthe back-to-the-water dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.78,0:17:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You must grow stronger to survive, child.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.24,0:17:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking advantage of her enemy's momentum,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.16,0:18:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,she lures them to the edge of the ring\Nand stands with her back to the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.80,0:18:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.71,0:18:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,she dodges her opponent's\Ndefenses with lightning speed,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.58,0:18:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,causing them to barrel\Nright into the vault!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.54,0:18:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, because of that technique,\Ndespite fighting in countless battles.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.18,0:18:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca has never once wounded anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.96,0:18:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,She uses observation Haki sweet Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.88,0:18:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca's also never been\Nwounded during a match.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.84,0:18:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,So far, she's won every fight just by\Nletting her foes fall off the side.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.54,0:18:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.45,0:18:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What a trooper!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.72,0:18:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Good job, Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.64,0:18:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Remarkable fighting style, even\Nif she's hardly fighting at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.76,0:19:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I must grudgingly admit, there's\Nsomething beautiful about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.50,0:19:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, it may define its\Nmatch in this competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.04,0:19:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The other warriors have their own unique\Nways of eliminating their opponents.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.20,0:19:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They are world-class gladiators.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.52,0:19:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.50,0:19:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.06,0:19:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I get to pulverize you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.98,0:19:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get this going, little weed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.72,0:19:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Next patient, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.48,0:19:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sai from the Kano Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.46,0:19:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the last patient?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.50,0:19:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You carried our old man back there\Nand haven't said a stinking word.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.40,0:19:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean Mr. Qin Zhao?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.50,0:20:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If he ain't dead, then what gives?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.16,0:20:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.34,0:20:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.70,0:20:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.76,0:20:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody cares.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.94,0:20:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I know he's getting old,\Nso it's no surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.18,0:20:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give me the truth. If the man's dead,\Nyou're supposed to tell the next of kin.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.64,0:20:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you keep it down?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.82,0:20:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You're overreacting sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.34,0:20:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The situation's not nearly\Nas dramatic as all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.34,0:20:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There's an exit in the back\Nof the infirmary After you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.52,0:20:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,get treated you don't come\Nback to the waiting room.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.00,0:20:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.64,0:20:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I made such a big scene over nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.78,0:20:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, glad we cleared\Nit up now, please go in
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.92,0:20:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.82,0:20:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for the confusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.42,0:20:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel terrible for\Nputting you on the spot
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.52,0:20:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on my knees, asking, begging you\Nfor your forgiveness. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.50,0:20:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just a little emotional.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.96,0:20:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll get over it
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.30,0:20:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.62,0:20:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Just lie down on the bed\Nhere and we'll get started
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.74,0:20:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.86,0:21:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and you'll need to close your eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.88,0:21:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, commencing examination
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.88,0:21:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.14,0:21:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Send in the next one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.64,0:21:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.32,0:21:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Bunch of dolls?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.48,0:21:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like a trash heap.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.20,0:21:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Made of of toys and fighters.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.20,0:21:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.84,0:21:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.32,0:21:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyrudin?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.20,0:21:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,all you guys
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.40,0:21:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,what the hell is this place
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.84,0:21:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,you're alive well that's\Ngood news I'm happy
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.28,0:21:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,what part about any of this is good news
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.58,0:21:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,you idiot my guess is if you lose the\Ntournament you're chucked thrown out with the
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.42,0:21:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,trash thrown out what does that mean how
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.30,0:21:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,are we gonna get out\Nof here there is no way
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.96,0:22:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,out we were set up by\Nthat bastard Doflamingo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.16,0:22:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an act of war.\NOur king is a bellow!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.44,0:22:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hate to say it, but even my\Nking, Punch, can't break us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.54,0:22:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You realize we're underground, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.78,0:22:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means these walls are solid earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.44,0:22:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course your technique\Ndoesn't work, idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.18,0:22:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all strong, and none of\Nour techniques will get us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.96,0:22:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What's their endgame here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.52,0:22:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they collecting fighters or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.62,0:22:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is, I doubt they\Nplan on tending to our wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.30,0:22:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I will curse you for\Nthis offense, Doflamingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.80,0:22:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll curse your children\Nand grandchildren too!
